WEBVTT

00:35:58.616 --> 00:36:00.777
and make you feel connected, too.

00:36:00.801 --> 00:36:02.321
(Music)

00:36:02.770 --> 00:36:06.112
When Jane first introduced me
to the idea of high-quality connections,

00:36:06.136 --> 00:36:07.356
I found it liberating,

00:36:07.380 --> 00:36:10.546
because relationships, whether
they're with colleagues or friends,

00:36:10.570 --> 00:36:12.006
they take a lot of work.

00:36:12.030 --> 00:36:14.502
And realizing that there are
all these opportunities

00:36:14.526 --> 00:36:16.504
to feel a momentary
connection with people

00:36:16.528 --> 00:36:18.268
even if I might never see them again

00:36:18.292 --> 00:36:19.447
was freeing.

00:36:21.880 --> 00:36:24.502
Loneliness won't be solved
through one action.

00:36:24.526 --> 00:36:26.760
But small interactions day by day

00:36:26.784 --> 00:36:28.754
are the building blocks
of real connection

00:36:28.778 --> 00:36:30.076
to the people around you.